                  "text": "Hos 9:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ole wangu! Maana mimi ni kama hapo walipokwisha kuyachuma matunda ya wakati wa joto, kama zabibu zichumwazo baada ya mavuno; hapana shada la kuliwa; roho yangu inatamani tini iivayo kwanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
